{"steam_appid":622650,"steam_name":"Bendy and the Ink Machine","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/622650/567000514/b1ac45121f429341b8f0f0f9accd138570ec6d83/1750563536/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746814531","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137368/f0808ced4b182bac741c1369b05c1a34d208a3b4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746814531","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/31876c3b562d5837a263b81dd505ae45c9dfce2e/ss_31876c3b562d5837a263b81dd505ae45c9dfce2e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784850256","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/06e9f7d9f6acb550afc423b2cde48160633db805/ss_06e9f7d9f6acb550afc423b2cde48160633db805.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784850256","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/da64295055cc7247e8a2dbe631e0e9d134e718c9/ss_da64295055cc7247e8a2dbe631e0e9d134e718c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784850256","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/76537725205ffebea38a5129c5c2f90bf85930be/ss_76537725205ffebea38a5129c5c2f90bf85930be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784850256","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/dd84e3cccc22cee167bb2729dec87c1fda0ca98c/ss_dd84e3cccc22cee167bb2729dec87c1fda0ca98c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784850256"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/dcd9abf845acb3e24960bdd855828c54.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/8696f5e172c657e0f33d2ee6aca87942.poster.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/8696f5e172c657e0f33d2ee6aca87942.webm?t=1784850256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore as Henry as he revisits the old demons of his past by travelling deep into the abandoned animation workshop of Joey Drew Studios, a studio with a dark history. With twists and turns around every corner, &quot;Bendy and the Ink Machine&quot; is sure to keep you on edge... and decimate your childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/b68a94062e1214cdd6962fd653b94def.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/d3a10aa1246265102b5b09f7b1b91c44.poster.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/d3a10aa1246265102b5b09f7b1b91c44.webm?t=1784850256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply atmospheric and spine-tingling experience with secrets hiding behind it's drawn walls and scribbled doors. Traverse into the shadows, where the monsters of the past dwell and our creations come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/27e992d56af40f5b75add997a8a1e537.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/1dfa08969d59433a208fd226613a148f.poster.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/1dfa08969d59433a208fd226613a148f.webm?t=1784850256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends and foes will help or hinder your path as you unravel the great mystery of the studio. Whom can you trust? What horrors await your next encounter? Insanity is the name of the game down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/71fdd3b565d15fedb1f38a1bb244f921.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/7447a09804f4ff09969cd19377e7c2d7.poster.avif?t=1784850256\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/622650/extras/7447a09804f4ff09969cd19377e7c2d7.webm?t=1784850256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures of the Dark Puddles surround you as you are faced with puzzling obstacles. You're never alone. You're never safe. Your animated nightmares are just beginning.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB Dedicated<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Joey Drew Studios"],"publishers":["Joey Drew Studios"],"release_date":"27 Apr, 2017"}